      "content": "MeteoSource provides an Air Quality API delivering hour-by-hour pollution data for any location on Earth, with forecasts up to 5 days ahead. The API also offers weather forecast data, location lookup, weather maps, and historical Time Machine data.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: MeteoSource",
